		<div class="carousel-container">
			<div class="carousel">
				<img src="img/projects/automation_server/nocodb_dashboard.png" alt="The NocoDB workspace, listing many bases such as Unit Registration History, BILL Automations, and Council Vehicles used across the council">
				<img src="img/projects/automation_server/nocodb_camping_reg_view.png" alt="A NocoDB grid view of camping registrations, with columns for registration number, camp, subcamp, campsite, and booking date across thousands of rows">
				<img src="img/projects/automation_server/n8n_dashboard.png" alt="The n8n workflow overview, showing 596 production executions with a 0.03% failure rate and 52 hours of estimated time saved, above a list of active workflows">
				<img src="img/projects/automation_server/n8n_flow.png" alt="An n8n workflow canvas for a poster pickup request, chaining a webhook trigger through NocoDB lookups and updates to a final message send">
				<img src="img/projects/automation_server/dozzle_dashboard.png" alt="The Dozzle dashboard, listing the server's five running containers (nocodb, n8n, directus, traefik, dozzle) with their live CPU and memory usage">
